# Curated installed-state check for combo stage skipping (MODE=all only).
# Format: <payload path relative to the stage dir>|<absolute destination>
#   ?prefix  = only check when the destination directory exists
#   !prefix  = the absolute path must exist
# The 598 tzdata zoneinfo files are covered by their version marker; they are
# installed atomically to a new tree and activated by rename.
payload/bin/tweaks_daemon|/rw_data/tweaks/tweaks_daemon
payload/bin/tweaks_persist|/rw_data/tweaks/tweaks_persist
payload/bin/wrandr|/usr/bin/wrandr
